Here is the new app requirement:

We need to create a streamlit app to add user email address, group name, from date, to date to the below table

DB_CORE_PRD.PSG.ABOVE_STORE_USER_GROUP_MEMBERS

UPN- Users email address
USER_GROUP_NAME - Group Name (we need to hardcode this in the app and provide as options to select with checkboxes.One user can be assigned with multiple groups)
FROM_DATE- Access start date and time
TO_DATE - Access end date and time
CREATED_TS - It should auto populate the inserted time
CREATED_BY- It should auto pick the users email address who added it
UPDATED_TS - Keep it NUll
UPDATED_BY - Keep it NUll

We should create 3 tabs in the app

1. View

We should be qucikly able to search user's email address see what access currently the user as

2. Provision

Here we should be able to add user's email address and options to choose the group names as checkboxes with group name
here are group names we should hardcode it in the app 

